create storage class for mongodb

apiVersion: storage.k8s.io/v1
kind: StorageClass
metadata:
  name: mongodb-local
provisioner: kubernetes.io/no-provisioner
volumeBindingMode: WaitForFirstConsumer


Why no-provisioner?

Because we're creating PVs manually. Unlike AWS EBS, KIND doesn't have a cloud storage provisioner to create disks automatically.


